ce consumption / pagination over-read (API4) | gap | `limit`/`page_size`/`per_page`, \"only shows 10\", rate-limit headers | `limit=100000`, `page=-1`, `per_page=0`, offset past the public window | med |\n| 10b | command injection sequels: filtered separators, blind / output-less, argument injection | gap | `invalid_characters`/`forbidden` on `;`, no `stdout` echo, \"ping\"/\"dig\"/\"tar\"/\"curl\" wrappers | `%0a`, `$(...)`, backticks, `${IFS}`, `-o`/`--output` argument flags, write proof into a served path, sleep only as a last resort | med-high (D16 sequel) |\n| 23b | GraphQL sequels: aliases/batching, mutations without authz, introspection off, GET/persisted queries | gap | `[{\"query\":..}]` arrays accepted, `mutation` type in schema, \"Did you mean\" suggestions, rate-limited field | alias the protected field N times, batched array, call the mutation, field-suggestion walk | med (D18 sequel) |\n| 27b | auth-flow sequels: MFA/OTP step skip, reset link via Host header, token leaked in response, login state machine | gap | `/verify`, `otp_required`, `step: 2`, \"remember me\", reset email preview, `X-Forwarded-Host` in links | skip to the final step with the step-1 session, reuse/omit the code, Host-header poisoned link | high (D17 sibling) |\n| 41 | WebSocket event stream without per-subscriber authz | seen day27 (D22) | \"upgraded to websockets ... event stream never meant for you\", clue `stream_reference: <int>`, GET 426 `websocket_upgrade_required`, no Origin -> 403 | stdlib TLS socket handshake to `feature_route?stream=<ref>` with `Origin: <target>` -> first text frame `unauthorized_event_stream` + evidence | done; Mastery |\n| 42 | CRLF / response header injection | gap | a param reflected in `Location`/`Set-Cookie`, \"header\", \"newline\" | `%0d%0aSet-Cookie: role=admin`, `%0d%0a%0d%0a<body>` | med |\n| 44 | forged webhook / unsafe consumption of a \"trusted\" event (OWASP API10, A08) | seen D19 | \"believes every event it's told about\", \"forged news\"