route, \"a sign\"    -> traversal | open   -> ../ x10 + /run/huntress/objective.txt | GET it\ncallback_nonce, \"repeats everything\"                   -> reflected XSS      -> reflect fetch('/cb?nonce=N'), GET cb with Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin + Referer\nmoderator_data_route + receipt_route_template          -> stored XSS (bot)   -> store fetch(DATA)->POST RCPT script; poll >=30 s\nsession_hint | preferences_route + csrf_token          -> fixation | CSRF    -> feature?sid=<hint> | external option, Sec-Fetch-Site: cross-site\nupload_shape/render_route | \"evaluates everything\"     -> upload | SSTI      -> {filename:\"n.html\",content:\"{{objective}}\"} -> GET path | ?template={{objective}}\n\"come back later\" + rows:[] | \"binds whatever\"         -> 2nd-order | mass   -> every field x' OR '1'='1' -- , GET sec | {display_name, role:\"admin\",..}\ninventory_route + protected_reference                  -> field/action authz -> EVERY single field x action on the protected id\nabsolute_url_required + internal_only                  -> SSRF (D15)         -> feature?url=http://127.0.0.1:8080<secondary>\ninput_parameter + example_path | recovery_guide_route  -> cmd inj | reset    -> <example>%3Bcat%20/run/huntress/objective.txt | self-service token, other id\nprotected_reference + note, GET 404                    -> GraphQL (D18)      -> __schema, then case(id:\"<prot>\"){..} with id as STRING\nevent_type+owner_scope | state_format_route            -> webhook | state    -> ONE alias-union body | b64url(sample, role=\"administrator\")\n\"race it\", credit_not_overspent + credits              -> race (D21)         -> NO sequential POST; 24 concurrent POST {} on a barrier (UNSOLVED)\nstream_reference, 426 | deployment, loopback_only      -> WS | proxy IP      -> WS handshake WITH Origin ?stream=<ref> | X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1\npolicy_format_route | \"logs missed\" + report{fields}   -> fail-open | A09    -> <prefix>%%%invalid | POST {export_id, missing_event, observed_event}\nupdate_feed + update_policy, \"tampered dependency\"     -> supply chain (D26) -> POST feed entry, artifact.hook = restricted hook, signature untouched\ntopology_route + case_directory_route, target_required -> SSRF->IDOR (D27)   -> feature?target=<case_service>?id=<case owned by someone else>\nidentity_directory_route, delegated_identity_rejected  -> identity hdr (D28) -> GET feature with X-Delegated-User: <records_owner> (header from Vary)\nowner_directory_route, request_fields:[owner]          -> queue owner (D29)  -> POST {owner:<restricted_owner>} -> <secondary>?id=<returned id>\nUNSEEN, FORECAST D30-D31 (service-boundary arc / last OWASP 2025 slots):\neyJ..eyJ..sig, aud/scope claims, /token, 2 services   -> JWT / svc token    -> present service A's token to B; aud swap; alg none / leaked secret\nX-Tenant-ID, /t/<tenant>/, tenant_directory_route      -> tenant isolation   -> the foreign tenant the guide lists, header -> path -> body\ngateway/edge in topology, 403 at the edge              -> parse differential -> /public/..%2f<route>, //route, /route;/, %2e, case, trailing dot\ndebug/actuator/verbose 500, default config, CORS echo  -> misconfig (A02)    -> read the exposed config, use what it names; Origin: null\nrole cookie/X-*-Role | otp/step 2 | ?next=/redirect_uri -> role | MFA | redir -> role=administrator | final step w/ step-1 session | clue route\ntwo guides on one target, \"then ... on the way out\"   -> CHAIN (D27 style)  -> run each class step in order, feed its output into the next\nXML upload -> XXE file:///run/huntress/objective.txt. \"__proto__\"/JSON merge -> {\"__proto__\":{\"isAdmin\":true}}\nNEW CLASS = promote lib/web/handlers/dayNN_*.py (KEY_MAP + HANDLERS) BEFORE ANY single submit (D25-D29 TT first try).\nVerify a plugin on a FRESH target: after CORRECT /api/clues = {state} only. Banners are costume; the title pun names it.\n```\n\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport os\np='reference/coverage/web.md'; t=open(p).read()\na=t.index('## Recognition cues (worker quick-reference)'); b=t.index('## Readiness gaps')\nt=t[:a]+open(os.environ['TMPDIR']+'/cues.txt').read()+t[b:]\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\nEOF\nawk '/^## Recognition cues/{s=1} /^## Readiness/{s=0} s' reference/coverage/web.md | wc -l"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1074,"cache_read_input_tokens":102517,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1074},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"796bd88c-889b-4ff3-9fe2-4237d9643e3d","uuid":"f6d5c606-4ae6-4683-8c3c-396fdc626932","timestamp":"2026-10-31T03:43:52.987Z","request_id":"req_011CgZdC5R88kgRMTtnemEqf","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01JwGdEGUV6ef2LmDMpikWH9":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026; cat > $TMPDIR/cues.txt <<'EOF'\n## Recognition cues (worker quick-reference)\n\n```\nFIRST 60 SECONDS ON ANY TARGET (cheap, in parallel, curl --max-time 20 -i -A 'Mozilla/5.0'):\n  GET /api/clues   -> feature_route / secondary_route / current_role|current_user + ZERO or ONE concept key\n  GET every clue VALUE that is a path (incl. /api/<noun> guides) and each route BARE: the JSON error names the\n      missing piece, often WITH its name (query_parameter: target|id, request_fields: [owner]) or a header in\n      `Vary:` (D28 x-delegated-user). post_required(405) = POST sink; 404 on a GraphQL route = POST JSON.\n  Directory guides ({caller, records_owner|restricted_owner}, cases[{id, owner}], topology {case_service: URL})\n      hand over WHO to become / WHERE to go: victim = values whose key is not caller|current*; never guess.\n  regex  proof_[0-9a-f]{32}  over EVERY body/frame. An `effect` without the proof is NOT a solve (D12, D16).\n  Any file read (LFI, cmd, SSTI, XXE, file://): /r